{"about_the_game":"<strong>Game Description:</strong><br><br>Become the hero of a fantasy world and defend against monster invasions! <strong>Legacy of Defense - Prologue</strong> is an innovative defense game that combines side-scrolling action and deck-building elements. In the prologue, you can play the introductory version of <strong>Legacy of Defense</strong> and earn prologue-exclusive achievements.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096620/extras/dcce87a67bc42555a09b99c41fa8a985.poster.avif?t=1765314779\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096620/extras/dcce87a67bc42555a09b99c41fa8a985.webm?t=1765314779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096620/extras/dcce87a67bc42555a09b99c41fa8a985.mp4?t=1765314779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Side-Scrolling Action: Experience intense battles with stunning 2D graphics and intuitive controls. Feel the thrill of defending against waves of incoming monsters.<br><br>Deck-Building Strategy: Collect various cards to build your own deck. Each card contains powerful skills that require strategic play.<br><br>Fantasy Monsters: Face a variety of fantasy monsters that you can only imagine. Each monster has unique abilities that you must counter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096620/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.poster.avif?t=1765314779\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096620/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.webm?t=1765314779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096620/extras/28a868d1f6f5b6a21c0fef67ebe5a40e.mp4?t=1765314779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Skill Upgrades: Gain experience through battles and upgrade your hero\u2019s skills. Use powerful skills to more effectively sweep away the monsters.<br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096620/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.poster.avif?t=1765314779\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096620/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.webm?t=1765314779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096620/extras/9c7e4fa42764a857fee9606d893315ad.mp4?t=1765314779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defend against waves of incoming monsters. Choose cards to use skills and defeat your enemies. Strategic deck-building is the key to victory. Clear each stage and face increasingly powerful monsters to defeat the final boss!<br><br>Legacy of Defense - Prologue: Test your strategy and skills. Are you ready to become the brave hero and save the fantasy world?","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096620/bac36c753fe16cd3f0e44831d9bc88339673e42c.jpg"},{"name":"Companion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096620/0e76f530e793e1819775999bd94a029874d65a0a.jpg"},{"name":"Chicken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096620/9240377f75f211987a7e4b0afb87e112f0b9c98c.jpg"},{"name":"Mutation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096620/daf88918fe7d07780d080b4bbc7a418f7d531c68.jpg"},{"name":"King Hog","path":"https://cdn.akama